```mermaid
%% @version 1.0.0
%% @date 2026-07-24
%% @type sequence
%% @level system
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as CLI User
    participant Orchestrator as Composite Orchestrator
    participant Config as Composite Config
    participant Seed as Seed Pipeline
    participant Enricher1 as Enricher Pipeline 1
    participant Enricher2 as Enricher Pipeline 2
    participant FSM as Composite FSM
    participant Merge as Merge Operation
    participant Resolver as Conflict Resolver
    participant Validator as Output Validator
    participant Storage as Storage Writer
    participant Metrics as Metrics/Tracing

    Note over CLI, Storage: Composite Pipeline Sequence (ADR-026)

    %% CLI Invocation Phase
    CLI->>Orchestrator: bioetl run <composite> <config>
    Orchestrator->>Config: Load composite config
    Config->>Config: Validate composite structure
    Config->>Config: Resolve seed pipeline config
    Config->>Config: Resolve enricher pipeline configs
    Config->>Config: Validate merge configuration
    Config-->>Orchestrator: Validated composite config
    Orchestrator->>Metrics: Emit composite_start metric
    Orchestrator->>Metrics: Start composite span

    %% Seed Pipeline Execution
    Orchestrator->>Seed: Execute seed pipeline
    Seed->>Metrics: Emit seed_start metric
    Seed->>Metrics: Start seed span
    Seed->>Seed: Run seed extraction
    Seed->>Seed: Apply seed transformations
    Seed->>Storage: Write seed to Bronze
    Seed->>Storage: Write seed to Silver
    Seed->>Metrics: Emit seed_complete metric
    Seed-->>Orchestrator: Seed pipeline result
    Orchestrator->>FSM: Update FSM state (seed_complete)

    %% Enricher Pipeline 1 Execution
    Orchestrator->>Enricher1: Execute enricher 1
    Enricher1->>Metrics: Emit enricher1_start metric
    Enricher1->>Metrics: Start enricher1 span
    Enricher1->>Enricher1: Read seed data
    Enricher1->>Enricher1: Apply enricher logic
    Enricher1->>Storage: Write enriched data to Silver
    Enricher1->>Metrics: Emit enricher1_complete metric
    Enricher1-->>Orchestrator: Enricher 1 result
    Orchestrator->>FSM: Update FSM state (enricher1_complete)

    %% Enricher Pipeline 2 Execution
    Orchestrator->>Enricher2: Execute enricher 2
    Enricher2->>Metrics: Emit enricher2_start metric
    Enricher2->>Metrics: Start enricher2 span
    Enricher2->>Enricher2: Read enriched data
    Enricher2->>Enricher2: Apply enricher logic
    Enricher2->>Storage: Write further enriched data to Silver
    Enricher2->>Metrics: Emit enricher2_complete metric
    Enricher2-->>Orchestrator: Enricher 2 result
    Orchestrator->>FSM: Update FSM state (enricher2_complete)

    %% Merge Operation
    Orchestrator->>Merge: Execute merge operation
    Merge->>Metrics: Emit merge_start metric
    Merge->>Metrics: Start merge span
    Merge->>Merge: Read all enriched data
    Merge->>Merge: Apply merge logic (union, join, etc.)
    
    %% Conflict Resolution
    alt Conflicts detected
        Merge->>Resolver: Resolve conflicts
        Resolver->>Resolver: Apply conflict resolution rules
        Resolver->>Resolver: Priority-based resolution
        Resolver->>Resolver: Custom merge functions
        Resolver-->>Merge: Resolved data
    else No conflicts
        Merge->>Merge: Proceed with merge
    end
    
    Merge-->>Orchestrator: Merged data
    Orchestrator->>FSM: Update FSM state (merge_complete)

    %% Output Validation
    Orchestrator->>Validator: Validate merged output
    Validator->>Metrics: Emit validation_start metric
    Validator->>Validator: Apply schema validation
    Validator->>Validator: Apply DQ validation
    Validator->>Validator: Apply business rules validation
    
    alt Validation passes
        Validator-->>Orchestrator: Validation success
        Orchestrator->>FSM: Update FSM state (validation_success)
    else Validation fails
        Validator->>Metrics: Emit validation_failed metric
        Validator-->>Orchestrator: Validation failure
        Orchestrator->>FSM: Update FSM state (validation_failed)
        Orchestrator->>Metrics: Emit composite_failed metric
        Orchestrator-->>CLI: Composite pipeline failed
    end

    %% Final Output Generation
    Orchestrator->>Storage: Write final output to Gold
    Storage->>Metrics: Emit gold_write_start metric
    Storage->>Metrics: Start gold_write span
    Storage->>Storage: Apply strict validation (ADR-018)
    Storage->>Storage: Commit to Gold
    Storage->>Metrics: Emit gold_write_complete metric
    Storage-->>Orchestrator: Gold write result

    %% Cleanup and Completion
    Orchestrator->>Metrics: Emit composite_complete metric
    Orchestrator->>Metrics: Finish composite span
    Orchestrator->>FSM: Update FSM state (composite_complete)
    Orchestrator-->>CLI: Composite pipeline result

    Note over CLI, Storage: End of Composite Pipeline Sequence
```

## Key Components

### Orchestrator
- **Composite Orchestrator**: Manages the complete composite pipeline lifecycle
- **FSM (Finite State Machine)**: Tracks composite pipeline state transitions
- **Config Loader**: Resolves and validates composite configuration

### Pipeline Components
- **Seed Pipeline**: Initial data extraction and basic transformation
- **Enricher Pipelines**: Parallel enrichment with domain-specific logic
- **Merge Operation**: Combines enriched data with conflict resolution
- **Conflict Resolver**: Handles data conflicts with priority-based resolution

### Validation and Storage
- **Output Validator**: Comprehensive validation before Gold writes
- **Storage Writer**: Handles final Gold writes with strict validation

### Observability
- **Metrics/Tracing**: Detailed metrics and tracing for each pipeline stage

## ADR References

- **ADR-026**: Composite Pipeline Pattern — composite pipeline structure and execution
- **ADR-018**: Gold Strict Validation — mandatory validation before Gold writes
- **ADR-023**: Entity Type Patterns — standardized entity naming in composite output
- **ADR-040**: Diagram Governance — diagram metadata and quality standards

## State Machine Transitions

The FSM tracks these states:
1. `seed_complete` — Seed pipeline finished successfully
2. `enricher1_complete` — First enricher finished
3. `enricher2_complete` — Second enricher finished
4. `merge_complete` — Merge operation finished
5. `validation_success` — Output validation passed
6. `validation_failed` — Output validation failed
7. `composite_complete` — Full composite pipeline finished

## Error Handling

- **Seed pipeline failure**: Halts composite execution
- **Enricher failure**: Continues with other enrichers if configured
- **Merge failure**: Reports conflict resolution failure
- **Validation failure**: Prevents Gold write, reports composite failure
- **Storage failure**: Emits storage error metric, reports failure
